  "title": "Poverty - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "The group aims to bring Senedd members together with organisations and people sharing an interest in working to tackle poverty. It aims to act as a convenor to build knowledge and understanding of poverty, develop support for strategic approaches to reducing it, and generate constructive external scrutiny of Welsh and UK government action on it.",
